# Vue, Vuetify & VueUse

**Language:** Write all component code, composables, comments, and related commit messages in **English**.

Applies to `ui/src/**/*.vue`, `ui/src/composables/**/*.ts`, and `ui/src/router/**/*.ts`. For state layers see `general.mdc`, `pinia-stores.mdc`, and `pinia-colada.mdc`.

## Official documentation

When unsure, **check the official docs first** before guessing:

| Library    | Docs                                          |
| ---------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| Vue 3      | [vuejs.org](https://vuejs.org/)               |
| Vue Router | [router.vuejs.org](https://router.vuejs.org/) |
| Vuetify 3  | [vuetifyjs.com](https://vuetifyjs.com/)       |
| VueUse     | [vueuse.org](https://vueuse.org/)             |

Plugin setup: `ui/src/plugins/vuetify.ts`, `ui/src/main.ts`.

