## Before finishing

- [ ] `<script setup lang="ts">`, typed props/emits, props destructured from `defineProps`
- [ ] Vuetify fields match neighbouring styling (`underlined`, `#48a0cc`, `font-size-input input-style`)
- [ ] User strings via `t()` / locale keys — not hardcoded
- [ ] Form validation uses `v-form` + project validation helper where applicable
- [ ] Browser/DOM utilities use VueUse when available
- [ ] In-app navigation uses Vue Router (`useRouter` / `useRoute`, `RouterName` / `RouterPathEnum`)
- [ ] Shared logic in `composables/` and exported from `index.ts` — single-use logic stays in the SFC
